{"format":"megamek-board","version":2,"size":{"width":29,"height":12},"name":"Rock Slopes and Cliffs","description":"Rock tops, slopes and cliff walls for material review. Three identical panels: rock theme (columns 1-9), grassland (columns 11-19) and dirt (columns 21-29); grassland and dirt cliff walls also show the rock material. Each has a 1-level staircase climbing south along its west edge, a level-4 mesa with cliffs facing all six directions, a level-2 terrace below its south side (two 2-level cliffs), and a lone level-3 pillar. Inspect from above and both oblique directions, at several hours.","options":{},"tags":["Example"],"notes":[{"at":[5,1],"text":["Rock"]},{"at":[15,1],"text":["Grassland"]},{"at":[25,1],"text":["Dirt"]},{"at":[1,11],"text":["1-level steps"]},{"at":[6,5],"text":["Level-4 mesa"]},{"at":[6,7],"text":["Level-2 terrace"]},{"at":[7,10],"text":["Level-3 pillar"]}],"hexes":[{"elevation":0,"at":[1,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[2,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[3,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[4,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[5,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[6,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[7,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[8,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[9,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[10,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[11,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[12,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[13,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[14,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[15,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[16,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[17,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[18,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[19,1]},{"elevation":0,"at":[20,1],"theme":"rock"},{"elevation":0,"at":[21,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[22,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[23,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[24,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[25,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[26,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[27,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[28,1],"theme":"dirt"},{"elevation":0,"at":[29,1],"the